    Update to admin interface release 2024-11-19 (#6315)
    
    This patch updates the admin interface to its latest release
    (2024-11-19). This will likely be the last admin interface update for
    Opencast 16 before it becomes the legacy release.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    - Build Opencast and go to the admin interface
    - The interface itself has already been tested
    
